Setup Instructions
Prerequisites
Python 3.9 or higher
Node.js
Ganache CLI
Install Ganache
npm install -g ganache
Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/<your-username>/library_registry.git
cd library_registry
Create virtual environment
python -m venv venv

# Windows
venv\Scripts\activate

# Mac/Linux
source venv/bin/activate
Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt
Start Ganache
ganache --deterministic --accounts 10 --port 8545
Configure settings (config/settings.py)
GANACHE_URL = "http://127.0.0.1:8545"
ADMIN_PRIVATE_KEY = "0x..."
ADMIN_ADDRESS = "0x..."

REGISTRY_CONTRACT_ADDRESS = ""
COIN_CONTRACT_ADDRESS = ""
Deploy contracts
python scripts/deploy.py
How to Run
Start the terminal app
python app/main.py
Run admin dashboard
python scripts/admin_dashboard.py
Start alert monitor
python scripts/alert_monitor.py
Run security test
python scripts/security_test.py
Export balance snapshot
python scripts/balance_snapshot.py
Generate data history report
python scripts/data_history_report.py
