Smart Contracts
LibraryRegistry.sol
Stores books (id, title, author, availability)
Handles borrow and return logic
Includes:
onlyOwner modifier
whenNotPaused modifier
user registration
batch operations
ownership transfer
LibraryCoin.sol
ERC-20 token (LBRC)
Admin-only minting
Functions:
totalSupply
balanceOf
transfer
